    <meta name='description' content='Dynasty hypersphere, Habsburg: the pocket world, to be Inlined in a host (it EXPORTs its shots, Probe, sensors and shaders). Radius = time: 1200 at the core, 1925 at the glass, 755.2 years per pocket unit, shells every 50 years. Azimuth: houses west to east, angle = 2 + people. Elevation: order of descent (layout only). Generated by build_hypersphere.py 1.2 from loom-view.json; do not edit.'/>
